   "line": [
    "Bxg5"
   ],
   "spoken": "Now it's time to take stock — keep the king in the centre for the moment, and set the priority: to make the open h-file pay, the defending bishop has to be eliminated so the advanced pawn behind it loses its guard.",
   "kind": "plan"
  },
  {
   "ply": 30,
   "t": 419.5,
   "fen": "2r1k2r/p3b1p1/2p1pnp1/q1pp2B1/3P3P/2N1P3/PPP2P2/R2Q1RK1 w k - 1 16",
