   "line": [
    "Ne2"
   ],
   "spoken": "The obvious knight jump fails to concrete calculation — a trade sequence leaves a pawn hanging with a fork and the queen crashing in. But failing on one move doesn't kill the plan; it only rules out that one route.",
   "kind": "tactic"
  },
  {
   "ply": 32,
