   "fen": "2r1k2r/p3b1p1/2p1p1p1/q1pp2Bn/3P3P/4P3/PPP1NP2/R2Q1RK1 w k - 3 17",
   "line": [
    "Nh5"
   ],
   "spoken": "So modify rather than abandon — the knight to h5 instead. It temporarily clogs the h-file, but piece placement is temporary while the long-term priority of prying that file open is permanent. Don't confuse a short-term blemish with a real problem.",
   "kind": "plan"
  },
