   "line": [
    "Nf6"
   ],
   "spoken": "The knight loops back around, and now the advanced enemy pawn simply can't be held. Distinguishing the temporary from the permanent is the whole art here — you can't make an omelette without cracking a few eggs.",
   "kind": "plan"
  },
